100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"aQ","roundness":null,"seed":1997820184,"version":2,"versionNonce":481806360,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1793699021400,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Specifics","fontSize":28,"fontFamily":7,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Specifics","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.15},{"id":"LlYE9sfb5GUpOxEfu19Gc","type":"text","x":850,"y":235,"width":359.3484,"height":337.5,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"aR","roundness":null,"seed":1877404776,"version":2,"versionNonce":26895720,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1793699021400,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"1. Can't evaluate the intent,\n   can only evaluate the code.\n   This problem is not solved yet.\n\n2. Reviewer and Validator agree with each\n   other too easily or are too strict.\n   Handled by \"tweaking\" the input prompts.\n\nWhat needs to be checked:\n- No infinite loop of passing things\n  back and forth. Ask an agent \"what can\n  be improved\" and it will always find\n  something.\n- The critic doesn't find new and new\n  bugs on every iteration.","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"1. Can't evaluate the intent,\n   can only evaluate the code.\n   This problem is not solved yet.\n\n2. Reviewer and Validator agree with each\n   other too easily or are too strict.\n   Handled by \"tweaking\" the input prompts.\n\nWhat needs to be checked:\n- No infinite loop of passing things\n  back and forth. Ask an agent \"what can\n  be improved\" and it will always find\n  something.\n- The critic doesn't find new and new\n  bugs on every iteration.","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"4oCaoY-QWk5t1-ebBXzdV","type":"rectangle","x":820,"y":780,"width":520,"height":260,"angle"